WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.458
Gasiliw ka jogo fila bɛɛ. A ye koo dɔ lakali.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.722
Wagati tɛmɛninw na, tagamasiyɛn si tun t'a ɲada la. A tun be se ka tɛmɛ bɛɛ kan ani a tun b'o lɔn.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.704
Loon o loon, a tun be to k'a filɛ a ɲada cɛɲumanba ye.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.528
Loon dɔ sɔgɔma, a y'a ye ko kamɛliɔn tun be tagara.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.440
O tuma na, mɔgɔkɔrɔba malasa, i bena se yan sanni sanji ka ben wa?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:51.906
A y'a kolonkolon k'a kunbiri gwan. Lɔnnikɛbaga ni sungurunin y'a daminɛ ka yɛlɛ ɲɔgɔn fɛ.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.744
O kɔ, a y'a fari yɛlɛma ani a ma foyi fɔ.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.754
O ye ɲɔgɔndan dɔ le ye. O yɔrɔ la, a tun be i n'a fɔ terimitiri wulen.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.336
Elefan min tun be tɛmɛna, ale sɔnna ka kɛ kititigɛbaga ye.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:33.636
O kɔ, a y'a fɔ u ye ko: "Aw k'aw tulo malɔ ka ɲa. Yiriw bɛɛ tun b'a fɛ k'o ye.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.312
Dugu gwɛra tuma min na, wara nin tun b'a yɛrɛ bonya mɔgɔw bɛɛ ɲana.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:59.522
Ka fara o kan, kamɛliɔn tun b'a fɛ ka gwɛrɛ. A yɛlɛnna a kɔ kan k'a fari furakɛ.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.866
Elefan le ka buru fiyɛ, kongowara fana wurira; a tɛ foyi ɲa i ko fɔɲɔ.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:26.914
A y'a ɲaa yɛlɛma, mɔgɔ si ma to a kɔ. A tun lanin b'a la ko a bena see sɔrɔ.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.770
A tun be to ka dɔrɔ min n'a ye. O kɔ, kamɛliɔn tun tɛ se k'a lamaga.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.920
O kɔ, a y'a yɛrɛ yɛlɛla.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.824
O kɔ, a lɔra ka yɛlɛko kɛ sira lakolon kan.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:10.722
O kɔ, kamɛliɔn bolila ka bɔ a kɔfɛ ka tɛmɛ. A ye see sɔrɔ!

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.952
Yirisun bɛɛ tun be yɛlɛla.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.218
A ma foyi fɔ tugun. A siɲɛ fɔlɔ la, a kasira.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:46.320
A ka maroya kosɔn, a ɲaji jigira k'a ɲada datugu.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.490
O kɔ, a y'a fɔ o ye ko: "Aw kana bɔ yan tuun.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:12.994
Kabi o wagati, gazelɔnw bɛɛ b'o jogo fila lo yira. Kameliyɔnw kɔni, u tɛ teliya ka taga.
